The code exhibits the Long Method code smell because the `main` function is too long. The refactoring technique to apply here is Extract Method. The idea is to break down the long method into smaller, more manageable methods.

Extract Method will involve creating new methods for each block of code that is too long to be in one method. This will allow us to keep the original behavior of the code while reducing its complexity.

